Representative work: A fully functional REST API with authentication, relational database storage, background processing, and comprehensive unit tests.', ARRAY['Design, build, and maintain robust server-side APIs', 'Model relational and document data with appropriate constraints and indexing', 'Implement secure authentication, session management, and authorization', 'Integrate third-party services, background jobs, and caching mechanisms', 'Write automated unit and integration tests for backend services']::text[], ARRAY['Client-server architecture and HTTP', 'RESTful API design and status codes', 'Asynchronous programming and event loops', 'Relational database schemas and SQL queries', 'Database migrations and transactions', 'User authentication and password hashing', 'JWT and session-based authorization', 'In-memory caching with Redis', 'API request validation and error handling', 'Containerization with Docker']::text[], 'ef1f3d98-5260-5d40-bd8e-8b330bbaf32f', 'published', 'Antigravity', 'Original Asgard-authored summaries; third-party resources linked only and retain their stated licenses', ARRAY['https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Overview', 'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Extensions/Server-side/First_steps/Web_frameworks', 'https://nodejs.org/en/learn/getting-started/introduction-to-nodejs', 'https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2/Git-Branching-Branching-Workflows', 'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Extensions/Async_JS/Introducing', 'https://expressjs.com/en/guide/using-middleware.html', 'https://expressjs.com/en/guide/error-handling.html', 'https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-constraints.html', 'https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/tutorial-select.html', 'https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/tutorial-transactions.html', 'https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/indexes-intro.html', 'https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Password_Storage_Cheat_Sheet.html', 'https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/JSON_Web_Token_for_Java_Cheat_Sheet.html', 'https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authorization_Cheat_Sheet.html', 'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/CORS', 'https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/get-started/', 'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fetch_API/Using_Fetch', 'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Basics_of_HTTP/MIME_types', 'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Extensions/Testing', 'https://docs.docker.com/get-started/docker-concepts/building-images/writing-a-dockerfile/', 'https://12factor.net/config', 'https://docs.docker.com/guides/walkthroughs/deploy-your-app/']::text[], 'Antigravity (curriculum expansion aligned with roadmap.sh)', '2026-11-04T12:00:00+00:00', 'Owner-requested catalog expansion to add 11 industry-standard careers aligned with roadmap.sh.', '{"activities": ["Design, build, and maintain robust server-side APIs", "Model relational and document data with appropriate constraints and indexing", "Implement secure authentication, session management, and authorization", "Integrate third-party services, background jobs, and caching mechanisms", "Write automated unit and integration tests for backend services"], "scope": "Comprehensive beginner-to-intermediate learning track"}'::jsonb, 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
