Authentication Workflow: Verifying credentials during login and returning authenticated session identifiers.

Learning outcome
Understand user authentication and password hashing, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

