INSERT INTO asgard_catalog.topics (id, roadmap_id, milestone_id, title, explanation, position) VALUES ('152138d1-4375-553a-9cf6-36582b227874', '9502cd4e-e337-53f0-8fc3-60cdd86658d9', 'e496d555-bff1-5461-9af9-09c9ef288ac6', 'Deploying and monitoring a REST API', 'Overview
Deploy your containerized backend API to a cloud host, configure health-check endpoints, and monitor runtime metrics.

What you''ll learn
- Health Checks
- Runtime Monitoring

Subtopics
Health Checks: Implementing /health and /ready endpoints that verify database connectivity and process liveness.
Runtime Monitoring: Tracking server uptime, response latency, and HTTP 5xx error rates in production.

Learning outcome
Understand deploying and monitoring a rest api, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Deploy your backend service, verify that the health check returns 200 OK, and simulate an error to confirm log capture.

Completion check
