Representative work: A cross-platform mobile application featuring interactive UI screens, local SQLite offline storage, device camera integration, API data sync, and automated mobile tests.', ARRAY['Design and build accessible, responsive mobile user interfaces', 'Manage mobile application state, navigation, and offline data persistence', 'Integrate device hardware APIs including camera, location, and biometrics', 'Connect mobile apps to REST and GraphQL backend services with background sync', 'Test, profile, and publish applications to the Apple App Store and Google Play']::text[], ARRAY['Mobile platform architectures (iOS vs Android)', 'Cross-platform toolchains (React Native / Flutter)', 'Mobile layout styling and flexbox', 'Touch gestures and navigation stacks', 'Local storage and offline-first persistence', 'REST and GraphQL API integration', 'Push notifications and background workers', 'Device hardware permissions (camera, location)', 'Mobile performance profiling and memory analysis', 'App signing and app store release management']::text[], 'ef1f3d98-5260-5d40-bd8e-8b330bbaf32f', 'published', 'Antigravity', 'Original Asgard-authored summaries; third-party resources linked only and retain their stated licenses', ARRAY['https://developer.android.com/guide/components/activities/activity-lifecycle', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/set-up-your-environment', 'https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/manifest-intro', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/images', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/flexbox', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/handling-touches', 'https://reactnavigation.org/docs/getting-started', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/appearance', 'https://react.dev/learn/managing-state', 'https://developer.android.com/training/data-storage', 'https://developer.android.com/topic/architecture/data-layer/offline-first', 'https://developer.android.com/training/permissions/requesting', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/network', 'https://developer.android.com/training/monitoring-device-state/connectivity-status-type', 'https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications', 'https://reactnavigation.org/docs/deep-linking', 'https://developer.android.com/training/camera', 'https://developer.android.com/training/location', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/optimizing-flatlist-configuration', 'https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/power', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/testing-overview', 'https://developer.apple.com/documentation/localauthentication', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/signed-apk-android', 'https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/']::text[], 'Antigravity (curriculum expansion aligned with roadmap.sh)', '2026-11-04T12:00:00+00:00', 'Owner-requested catalog expansion to add 11 industry-standard careers aligned with roadmap.sh.', '{"activities": ["Design and build accessible, responsive mobile user interfaces", "Manage mobile application state, navigation, and offline data persistence", "Integrate device hardware APIs including camera, location, and biometrics", "Connect mobile apps to REST and GraphQL backend services with background sync", "Test, profile, and publish applications to the Apple App Store and Google Play"], "scope": "Comprehensive beginner-to-intermediate learning track"}'::jsonb, 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
