Representative work: A cross-platform mobile application featuring interactive UI screens, local SQLite offline storage, device camera integration, API data sync, and automated mobile tests.' OR responsibilities IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY['Design and build accessible, responsive mobile user interfaces', 'Manage mobile application state, navigation, and offline data persistence', 'Integrate device hardware APIs including camera, location, and biometrics', 'Connect mobile apps to REST and GraphQL backend services with background sync', 'Test, profile, and publish applications to the Apple App Store and Google Play']::text[] OR skills IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY['Mobile platform architectures (iOS vs Android)', 'Cross-platform toolchains (React Native / Flutter)', 'Mobile layout styling and flexbox', 'Touch gestures and navigation stacks', 'Local storage and offline-first persistence', 'REST and GraphQL API integration', 'Push notifications and background workers', 'Device hardware permissions (camera, location)', 'Mobile performance profiling and memory analysis', 'App signing and app store release management']::text[] OR category_id IS DISTINCT FROM 'ef1f3d98-5260-5d40-bd8e-8b330bbaf32f' OR status IS DISTINCT FROM 'published' OR editor IS DISTINCT FROM 'Antigravity' OR source_license IS DISTINCT FROM 'Original Asgard-authored summaries; third-party resources linked only and retain their stated licenses' OR source_urls IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY['https://developer.android.com/guide/components/activities/activity-lifecycle', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/set-up-your-environment', 'https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/manifest-intro', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/images', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/flexbox', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/handling-touches', 'https://reactnavigation.org/docs/getting-started', 'https://reactnative.dev/docs/appearance', 'https://react.dev/learn/managing-state', 'https://developer.android.com/training/data-storage', 'https://developer.