y systems, and save/load persistence", "Integrate game sound effects, background music, and user interface HUDs", "Profile frame rates, optimize memory and draw calls, and export release builds"], "scope": "Comprehensive beginner-to-intermediate learning track"}'::jsonb OR revision IS DISTINCT FROM 1)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Published content identity already has different values'; END IF; END $asgard_content$;
