Diagnose frame rate dips, batch draw calls, optimize texture atlas sizes, and minimize CPU-GPU synchronization bottlenecks.

What you''ll learn
- Draw Call Batching
- Engine Profiler

Subtopics
Draw Call Batching: Combining multiple sprites or meshes into single render batches to reduce draw calls.
Engine Profiler: Using engine profiler monitors to see whether CPU script time, physics, or GPU rendering causes lag.

Learning outcome
Understand frame rate optimization and draw calls, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Open the engine profiler, analyze a scene with multiple objects, and optimize draw calls using a sprite atlas.

Completion check
