INSERT INTO asgard_catalog.topics (id, roadmap_id, milestone_id, title, explanation, position) VALUES ('65fef765-c271-5974-b037-bcd92a264b5b', '2747fd69-c19e-5bc0-8072-db5a001a424f', 'a5ae4fe7-0ad4-5919-be1b-5ce8c4cf043c', 'Generative AI and foundational model concepts', 'Overview
Learn how transformer-based Large Language Models work, including pre-training, instruction tuning, and temperature.

What you''ll learn
- Transformer Architecture Basics
- Inference Parameters

Subtopics
Transformer Architecture Basics: Self-attention mechanisms, next-token prediction, and parameter scale.
Inference Parameters: How temperature, top-p, and frequency penalties control output randomness and creativity.

Learning outcome
Understand generative ai and foundational model concepts, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Experiment with different temperature settings on an LLM API and compare determinism across identical prompts.

Completion check
You can show and explain the outcome of: experiment with different temperature settings on an llm api and compare determinism across identical prompts. Check that it functions as expected and meets requirements.', 0) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
