INSERT INTO asgard_catalog.topics (id, roadmap_id, milestone_id, title, explanation, position) VALUES ('d09d57ea-4742-5169-8108-6e6c36553b0b', '2747fd69-c19e-5bc0-8072-db5a001a424f', 'a5ae4fe7-0ad4-5919-be1b-5ce8c4cf043c', 'Tokenization, context windows and pricing models', 'Overview
Understand how text converts to tokens, manage context window limitations, and optimize API token costs.

What you''ll learn
- Token Mechanics
- Cost and Latency Optimization

Subtopics
Token Mechanics: How subwords, punctuation, and code convert to tokens using BPE tokenizers.
Cost and Latency Optimization: Calculating input vs output token costs and pruning unnecessary prompt context.

Learning outcome
Understand tokenization, context windows and pricing models, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Use a tokenizer utility to calculate token counts across text samples and estimate API request costs.

