INSERT INTO asgard_catalog.topics (id, roadmap_id, milestone_id, title, explanation, position) VALUES ('a8b5fbf9-1ba2-510c-b44c-b8319fe74329', '5b004de0-f2d8-5f68-9782-806a837dfd96', 'b954732c-09c9-5784-888d-d7891fbfe201', 'Business intelligence role and decision support', 'Overview
Learn how business intelligence bridges raw operational data and executive decision-making through timely reporting.

What you''ll learn
- The BI Lifecycle
- Descriptive vs Diagnostic Analytics

Subtopics
The BI Lifecycle: From data generation to ingestion, modeling, visualization, and strategic business action.
Descriptive vs Diagnostic Analytics: Answering ''What happened?'' and ''Why did it happen?'' with curated analytical data.

Learning outcome
Understand business intelligence role and decision support, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Map out the decision-making process of a business stakeholder and identify the key reports they rely on.

Completion check
You can show and explain the outcome of: map out the decision-making process of a business stakeholder and identify the key reports they rely on. Check that it functions as expected and meets requirements.', 0) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
