INSERT INTO asgard_catalog.topics (id, roadmap_id, milestone_id, title, explanation, position) VALUES ('45457766-a31b-56fd-9d1d-d38ef6e63c2a', 'edfa68df-4a87-52a5-afe6-7cf2537d616b', 'db75bbe1-8358-5455-8196-e7849b55f02b', 'Cloud service models: IaaS, PaaS, SaaS', 'Overview
Learn the trade-offs between Infrastructure as a Service, Platform as a Service, and Software as a Service.

What you''ll learn
- Service Model Trade-offs
- Shared Responsibility

Subtopics
Service Model Trade-offs: Comparing control, operational overhead, and flexibility across IaaS, PaaS, and serverless.
Shared Responsibility: Understanding which security and maintenance responsibilities belong to the cloud provider vs the customer.

Learning outcome
Understand cloud service models: iaas, paas, saas, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Categorize 5 common enterprise workloads into their optimal cloud service model (IaaS, PaaS, or SaaS).

Completion check
You can show and explain the outcome of: categorize 5 common enterprise workloads into their optimal cloud service model (iaas, paas, or saas). Check that it functions as expected and meets requirements.', 0) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
