Organize cloud resources with mandatory tags, create monthly cost budgets, and set up automated billing threshold alerts.

What you''ll learn
- Tagging Strategies
- Cost Alerts and Budgets

Subtopics
Tagging Strategies: Using tags (Environment, Project, Owner, CostCenter) to track ownership and allocate expenses.
Cost Alerts and Budgets: Configuring email or Slack alerts when forecasted monthly spend reaches 80% of budget limits.

Learning outcome
Understand resource tagging, budgets and cost alerts, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Define a corporate tagging policy schema and configure a budget alert that triggers if monthly spend exceeds a dollar threshold.

Completion check
