Automate daily snapshot backups of block storage volumes (EBS) and database instances with retention lifecycle rules.

What you''ll learn
- RPO and RTO Targets
- Automated Backup Policies

Subtopics
RPO and RTO Targets: Understanding Recovery Point Objective (acceptable data loss) and Recovery Time Objective (time to recover).
Automated Backup Policies: Using AWS Backup or cloud schedulers to enforce immutable, encrypted snapshot retention.

Learning outcome
Understand automated snapshot and backup strategies, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Configure an automated backup plan that creates daily encrypted snapshots of a database and deletes snapshots older than 30 days.

Completion check
You can show and explain the outcome of: configure an automated backup plan that creates daily encrypted snapshots of a database and deletes snapshots older than 30 days. Check that it functions as expected and meets requirements.', 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
