Synthesize VPC networking, load balancers, auto-scaling groups, managed databases, and IaC into a production deployment.

What you''ll learn
- The Reference Architecture
- Final Verification

Subtopics
The Reference Architecture: Public load balancer tier > private application compute tier > private isolated database tier.
Final Verification: Conducting end-to-end failover tests, load testing, and security group verification on the live system.

Learning outcome
Understand deploying a scalable multi-tier web architecture, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Provision and verify a complete 3-tier web architecture in code, proving that public internet traffic cannot directly reach the database.

Completion check
You can show and explain the outcome of: provision and verify a complete 3-tier web architecture in code, proving that public internet traffic cannot directly reach the database. Check that it functions as expected and meets requirements.', 3) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
