INSERT INTO asgard_catalog.topics (id, roadmap_id, milestone_id, title, explanation, position) VALUES ('6bd86a5e-be53-50d4-b6c5-dc321835a386', '5df0777c-53ba-5a29-9b9d-e290bae381bc', 'db890574-d59e-5815-a662-57ea25accf11', 'Superuser privileges and sudo configuration', 'Overview
Manage root administrative access securely, avoiding direct root logins, and configure granular permissions with visudo.

What you''ll learn
- The Principle of Least Privilege
- Configuring the Sudoers File

Subtopics
The Principle of Least Privilege: Why day-to-day operations should use unprivileged accounts elevated only when necessary.
Configuring the Sudoers File: Using visudo to grant specific users or groups passworded or passwordless sudo rights.

Learning outcome
Understand superuser privileges and sudo configuration, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Create a new administrative user, add them to the sudo/wheel group, and verify they can execute commands as root.

