Representative work: A hardened, compliance-audited cloud environment featuring zero-trust IAM roles, automated secret rotation, encrypted storage buckets with public access blocked, container vulnerability scanning in CI/CD, and real-time CloudTrail threat detection.' OR responsibilities IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY['Implement granular least-privilege Identity and Access Management (IAM) policies', 'Harden cloud network perimeters using security groups, NACLs, and Web Application Firewalls (WAF)', 'Enforce encryption at rest and in transit across cloud storage, databases, and key vaults', 'Audit cloud infrastructure for misconfigurations using Cloud Security Posture Management (CSPM)', 'Automate static security scanning for Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and container images']::text[] OR skills IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY['Cloud shared responsibility model and threat vectors', 'Least-privilege IAM policy design and role assumption', 'Multi-factor authentication (MFA) and SSO federation', 'VPC network defense, security groups, and NACLs', 'Cloud Key Management Services (KMS) and data encryption', 'Automated secrets management and credential rotation', 'Cloud Security Posture Management (CSPM) and CIS Benchmarks', 'Container and Kubernetes security (image scanning, RBAC)', 'Infrastructure as Code (IaC) static security analysis', 'Cloud audit logging (CloudTrail, VPC Flow Logs) and alerting']::text[] OR category_id IS DISTINCT FROM '1ed17600-05da-5bde-9ff5-3386cb9e9061' OR status IS DISTINCT FROM 'published' OR editor IS DISTINCT FROM 'Antigravity' OR source_license IS DISTINCT FROM 'Original Asgard-authored summaries; third-party resources linked only and retain their stated licenses' OR source_urls IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY['https://aws.amazon.com/compliance/shared-responsibility-model/', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/configuring-instance-metadata-service.html', 'https://www.cisecurity.org/benchmark/amazon_web_services', 'https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/207/final', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/access_policies.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_create_for-user.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_credentials_getting-report.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Route_Tables.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_SecurityGroups.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/waf/latest/developerguide/what-is-aws-waf.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/privatelink/what-is-privatelink.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/macie/latest/user/what-is-macie.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/overview.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/intro.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/access-control-block-public-access.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/systems-manager-patch.html', 'https://docs.docker.com/scout/', 'https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/security/overview/', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/guardduty/latest/ug/what-is-guardduty.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/config/latest/developerguide/WhatIsConfig.html', 'https://www.checkov.io/1.Welcome/What%20is%20Checkov.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awscloudtrail/latest/userguide/cloudtrail-user-guide.html', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/aws-security-incident-response-guide/welcome.html']::text[] OR reviewed_by IS DISTINCT FROM 'Antigravity (curriculum expansion aligned with roadmap.sh)' OR reviewed_at IS DISTINCT FROM '2026-11-04T12:00:00+00:00' OR revision_note IS DISTINCT FROM 'Owner-requested catalog expansion to add 11 industry-standard careers aligned with roadmap.sh.' OR relevance_attributes IS DISTINCT FROM '{"activities": ["Implement granular least-privilege Identity and Access Management (IAM) policies", "Harden cloud network perimeters using security groups, NACLs, and Web Application Firewalls (WAF)", "Enforce encryption at rest and in transit across cloud storage, databases, and key vaults", "Audit cloud infrastructure for misconfigurations using Cloud Security Posture Management (CSPM)", "Automate static security scanning for Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and container images"], "scope": "Comprehensive beginner-to-intermediate learning track"}'::jsonb OR revision IS DISTINCT FROM 1)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Published content identity already has different values'; END IF; END $asgard_content$;
