Implement recognized security frameworks including the Center for Internet Security (CIS) Cloud Foundations Benchmarks.

What you''ll learn
- CIS Benchmark Controls
- Compliance Auditing

Subtopics
CIS Benchmark Controls: Mandating root account MFA, disabling inactive credentials, and enabling multi-region audit trails.
Compliance Auditing: Automating compliance checks against regulatory frameworks (SOC 2, ISO 27001, HIPAA).

Learning outcome
Understand cloud security standards: cis benchmarks and iso 27017, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Audit a cloud account against the CIS Foundations Benchmark and list the top 3 high-severity non-compliant findings.

