Maintain continuous visibility over cloud asset configurations and remediate compliance drift automatically using CSPM tools.

What you''ll learn
- Configuration Auditing
- Automated Remediation

Subtopics
Configuration Auditing: Using AWS Config or cloud posture tools to record all configuration changes over time.
Automated Remediation: Triggering automated serverless functions to close security group ports opened accidentally.

Learning outcome
Understand cspm tools and automated drift detection, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Create a configuration rule that flags any security group allowing inbound port 22 from 0.0.0.0/0 as non-compliant.

Completion check
