Shift cloud security left by scanning Terraform and CloudFormation templates for security misconfigurations before deployment.

What you''ll learn
- Static IaC Analysis
- Enforcing Security Baselines

Subtopics
Static IaC Analysis: Using tools like Checkov, tfsec, or KICS in CI/CD pipelines to detect unencrypted disks and public buckets.
Enforcing Security Baselines: Failing pull requests automatically if newly proposed IaC configurations violate security policies.

Learning outcome
Understand infrastructure as code (iac) security scanning, complete the practical exercise, and explain the key concepts.

Tools and setup
Use a free editor (such as VS Code), modern web browser, and relevant local runtime/CLI; no paid service or subscription is required for these exercises.

Practice
Scan a Terraform configuration repository with Checkov and resolve 3 flagged security misconfigurations.

Completion check
You can show and explain the outcome of: scan a terraform configuration repository with checkov and resolve 3 flagged security misconfigurations. Check that it functions as expected and meets requirements.', 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
